      "type": "paragraph",
      "props": {},
      "text": [
        {
          "insert": "archetype",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " is document metadata describing broad intent. "
        },
        {
          "insert": "\"singleOutput\"",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": "\nmarks a bounded-completion prompt and "
        },
        {
          "insert": "\"workflow\"",
          "attributes": {
            "code": true
          }
        },
        {
          "insert": " marks a multi-step or\nprocess prompt, but the type is deliberately open, any string is valid, so\nnew prompt families do not require a schema change. Tooling may use the\narchetype to pick defaults or grouping; nothing in rendering or validation\ndepends on it."
        }
